{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00181","headline":"延英殿玉灵芝诗三章章八句 一 · 肃宗皇帝","name":"延英殿玉灵芝诗三章章八句 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉殿肃肃，灵芝煌煌。\n重英发秀，连叶分房。\n宗庙之福，垂其耿光。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"肃宗皇帝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00181.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00181","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}